    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: What was that sound?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: GRRRRRRRR!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: We have to be carefull
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: It's never Lupus!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: It's never Lupus!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: This is the dreamworld. There are entities that roam, press F to keep
        them away or you can hide from them by pressing H.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Hi, I am the patient. I am supposed to stay beside you. I can give hint
        about different memories
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Oh by the way...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8451805815172884903, guid: b25e08f8579e256468fee4ef832249d2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conversations.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].speaker
